      "id": "2026-10-10-s1",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "football",
      "title_zh": "不出去了",
      "title_en": "Not going out",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["今天", "下午", "，", "朋友", "叫", "我", "出去", "玩", "。"],
        ["我", "说", "：", "“", "不", "行", "，", "我", "要", "在", "家", "看", "球", "。", "”", "六", "点", "有", "曼联", "的", "球", "。"],
        ["五", "点", "半", "，", "我", "就", "坐", "在", "电视", "前", "了", "。", "我", "准备", "了", "很", "多", "吃", "的", "。"],
        ["曼联", "进", "了", "一", "个", "球", "！", "我", "就", "给", "朋友", "打", "电话", "。"],
        ["朋友", "说", "：", "“", "我", "也", "在", "看", "！", "我", "现在", "就", "在", "你", "家", "门", "外", "！", "”", "我们", "就", "一起", "看", "了", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "This afternoon my friend asked me to go out.",
        "I said: “No, I’m going to watch the football at home.” Man United were playing at six.",
        "By half past five I was already sitting in front of the TV. I’d got lots of snacks ready.",
        "Man United scored! I phoned my friend straight away.",
        "My friend said: “I’m watching too! I’m right outside your front door!” So we watched it together."
      ],
      "names": ["曼联"],
      "new_words": ["下午", "出去", "电视"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "下午", "english": "afternoon" },
        { "word": "出去", "english": "to go out" },
        { "word": "电视", "english": "TV" },
        { "word": "曼联", "english": "Manchester United" }
      ]
    },
