      "title_zh": "找到工作了",
      "title_en": "I found a job",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "是", "大学", "学生", "，", "我", "想", "找", "工作", "。"],
        ["朋友", "给", "我", "介绍", "了", "一", "个", "工作", "。", "我", "就", "去", "了", "那里", "。"],
        ["一", "个", "男人", "问", "我", "：", "“", "你", "叫", "什么", "名字", "？", "”", "我", "告诉", "了", "他", "。"],
        ["他", "还", "问", "：", "“", "你", "什么", "时候", "能", "来", "？", "”", "我", "说", "：", "“", "明天", "就", "能", "来", "！", "”"],
        ["他", "笑", "了", "：", "“", "好", "，", "明天", "见", "！", "”", "现在", "我", "有", "工作", "了", "！", "我", "要", "谢谢", "我", "的", "朋友", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "I'm a university student, and I want to find a job.",
        "My friend told me about a job, so I went there.",
        "A man asked me: “What’s your name?” I told him.",
        "He also asked: “When can you start?” I said: “I can come tomorrow!”",
        "He smiled: “Great, see you tomorrow!” Now I have a job! I want to thank my friend."
      ],
